{"seq":2,"slug":"cultural-legacy","title":"Cultural Legacy","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/influence-and-legacy/cultural-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-confucian-exemplar","title":"立德立功立言","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/influence-and-legacy/cultural-legacy/a-confucian-exemplar","wordCount":1621,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"books-and-popularity","title":"当代的曾国藩热","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/influence-and-legacy/cultural-legacy/books-and-popularity","wordCount":1749,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现曾国藩的文化遗产。他成就了\"立德、立功、立言\"三不朽，被一些人推崇为\"半个圣人\"（这一评价既崇高又有保留，反映了他的复杂性）。在当代，曾国藩更重新引起广泛关注，掀起了一股\"曾国藩热\"——其著作、传记、解读大量涌现，深受欢迎；这既体现了其智慧的当代价值，也需警惕肤浅化、功利化的曲解。本章揭示曾国藩的文化遗产及其复杂性。\n"}